4.5 Batch Mode (Diverse Experiments)

For complex experiments where every sample has a different reference or gRNA, use a Config CSV.

```bash
python cleanfinder.py --batch config.csv -o results_folder/
```

`config.csv` Requirements:
The CSV must have headers. Recommended columns: `sample_name`, `fastq`, `reference`, `grna`, `mode`.
```csv
sample_name,fastq,reference,grna,mode
Well_A1,A1_reads.fq,ref_vhl.fa,TCTGCAGAATGTCAAAG,cas9
Well_B1,B1_reads.fq,ref_tp53.fa,GACTCCAGTGGTAATCT,cas12
```

